#################################################################



# Governance ruling: created when this package's own governance decisions were
# moved out of prose into the ontology (EP_Rulings); actively used every time
# the lineage-discipline gate checks a ruling's own enforcement claim against
# the shapes. Never suspended or terminated by design -- this package's own
# discipline is "a rule keeps its incident": a ruling's mechanism can retire,
# but the ruling's own text and record never do, so those two stages are a
# genuine, honest gap, not an oversight.

# Code table: created across EP_CodeTables/EP_StandardRows/EP_TablesBatch;
# actively used by every shape and script that queries a table's own rows.

# Tool script: created across EP_RuleExec/EP_ScriptDecisions, where scripts
# stopped deciding and started executing; actively used every validation run
# this whole session performed.

