#  L_OntologyDriven ORDERED, backlog output 6a0143c; parts L7_Gov,
#  L7_Exec, L7_Export, L7_Prose, L7_Code all ORDERED (five outputs each,
#  Backlog at 76159bd); 38 items admitted; no thrash. Sequence witnessed:
#  bypass 4423fdc 12:49 < restart 2f28bac 13:11 < Mission 9cb62b6 13:24
#  < Scope 8c4f385 < Goal 5a6894e < Objective 7a4fee7 < Backlog 76159bd
